---
title: "Maa Tujhe Salaam"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "Eb"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

{c: Verse1}

[Eb]Yahan wahan sara jahan dekh liya hai,

[Ab]Kahin bhi [Bb]tere jaisa [Cm]koi na [Bb]hi hai;

[Eb]Assi nahin saw din duniya ghuma hai,

[Ab]Nahin kahin [Bb]tere jaisa [Cm]koi na [Bb]hi hai.

[Ab]Mein [Eb]gaaya jahan bhi, [Ab]bas [Eb]teri yaad thi,

[Ab]Jo [Eb]mere saath thi, muzkho tadapati rulati.

[Bb]Sabse pyaari teri surat, pyaar hai bas tera pyaar hai.

[Eb]Maa tuzhe salaam,Maa tuzhe salaam,Amma tuzhe salaam...

{c: Chorus}

[Eb]Vande Maat [Bb]aram [X2]

[Cm]Vande [Eb]Maataram [Bb]Vande [Eb]Maataram [X2]

[Eb]Vande Maataram [X2]

{c: Verse2}

(repeat the same pattern of Verse1)

Janmo ka ye bhaag hai, ye teraa thikanaa hai

Chuonna chhukaoon tere pyar kaa tarana hai

Chandaa nahin suraj nahin, duniyaa ki daulat nahi

Bas lootungaa tere pyaar kaa khajana

Ek nazar jab teri ek nazar jab teri

Hoti hai pyaar ki hoti hai pyaar ki

Duniyaa tab to meri, chamke, damke, mehke re

Tera chehraa suraj jaisaa, chandse band hai pyaar me

{c: Chorus}

[Eb]Vande Maat [Bb]aram [X2]

[Cm]Vande [Eb]Maataram [Bb]Vande [Eb]Maataram [X2]

[Eb]Vande Maataram [X2]

{c: Bridge}

[Eb]Tere paas hi [Eb]mein aa raha hun, [Ab]apni [Cm]bahen [Bb]khol de

[Eb]Zhor se muzhko [Eb]gale laga le, [Ab]mujhko [Cm]phir woh [Bb]pyaar de

[Eb]Aaaa......[Bb]aaaa.......[Ab]aaaaa......[Cm]aaaaa

[Eb]Tu hi bas zindagi hai, [Bb]tu hi meri mohobbat hai

[Bb]Tere hi pairo mein jannat hai

[Bb]Tu hi dil, tu hi jaan, tu wafah

{c: Chorus}

[F]Vande Mata [Gm]ram [C]Vande Mata [F]ram [PLAY HARD]

[F]Vande Mata [Gm]ram [C]Vande Mata [F]ram [PLAY HARD]

[F]Vande Mata [Gm]ram [C]Vande Mata [F]ram [PLAY SOFT]

[F]Vande Mata [Gm]ram [C]Vande Mata [F]ram [FADE...]
